<title>POLAND: Polisa plunges on Q1 loss, profit-taking.</title>
<headline>Polisa plunges on Q1 loss, profit-taking.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish insurer Polisa SA plunged 9.6 percent to 8.5 zlotys in thin 719,000-zloty turnover after an eight percent leap on Monday and later announcement of a first quarter loss, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;The fall is a combination of two factors -- the loss and yeaterday's jump, which was not justified by fundamentals,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>On Monday Polisa reported a 1.7-million-zloty net loss in the first quarter of 1997. As an insurance firm Polisa is not obliged to report its results monthly and releases only quarterly reports.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
